# Evidence run artifacts — generated by bench executions, not source code.
# Canonical references (scenario-evidence.json, campaign-manifest.json,
# STATUS.md) and 009A readiness evidence are tracked explicitly via negation.
implementation/*/evidence/**/runs/
implementation/*/evidence/**/profiles/*/runs/
implementation/*/evidence/**/profiles/*/scenario-evidence.validated-superseded.json
implementation/*/evidence/**/profiles/*/runs/**/SUPERSEDED.md